<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - McLeod raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - McLeod raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers said it upgraded McLeod Inc to buy.  </p>
<p>-- Said believes profit and loss performance &quot;will start to drive McLeod's stock price.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Target price is $32 per share.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1/4 to 21-1/4.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
